# Trivy waivers for the image scan (scripts/ci/scan_image.sh; Phase 8 SD21, AC4).
#
# Empty on purpose. A fixable CRITICAL or HIGH fails the build; the first remedy
# is a newer base-image digest. Waiving one is a human decision, and each entry
# is two lines -- a reason, then the ID with an expiry -- so no waiver outlives
# its review (tests/meta/test_trivyignore.py enforces both):
#
#   # reason: <why this does not apply, or what blocks the fix; who decided>
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31

